#: ../../source/sql/mysql_protocol.md:1 840b2091431c43179a156dc6d4996d92
msgid "MySQL Protocol"
msgstr "MySQL 协议"

#: ../../source/sql/mysql_protocol.md:3 53cb8a2380074461bf41c078513360f5
msgid ""
"MySQL protocol is the protocol used for communication between MySQL "
"database server and client. It is a binary protocol based on TCP/IP "
"protocol, used for transferring data between client and server. The main "
"purpose of MySQL protocol is to allow clients to connect to MySQL server "
"and perform various operations."
msgstr ""
"MySQL 协议是 MySQL 数据库服务器与客户端之间的通信协议。它是基于 TCP/IP 协"
"议的二进制协议，用于在客户端和服务器之间传输数据。MySQL 协议的主要目的是"
"允许客户端连接到 MySQL 服务器并执行各种操作。"

#: ../../source/sql/mysql_protocol.md:6 cae087f78d75463ea2748e4db37da1a0
